<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman ups British Energy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman ups British Energy.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Energy Plc was raised to &quot;market performer&quot; from &quot;market underperformer&quot; at Goldman Sachs, the investment bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Goldman also raised its price target for the nuclear power generator to 242p from 230p, but further detail was not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
